WEBVTT

00:15.463 --> 00:16.984
We

00:26.730 --> 00:35.375
shall

00:35.455 --> 00:39.598
see the wings of the white dragon.

00:42.203 --> 00:46.488
The walls are cold, the air is thin The noise

00:46.628 --> 00:52.174
outside is closing in I'm running from the face I

00:52.254 --> 00:57.540
see The victims say they made of me This rage is

00:57.600 --> 01:01.945
just a heavy stone of gravity

01:03.741 --> 01:08.670
Shedding skin, shedding weight Escaping from

01:08.690 --> 01:15.262
this world of rage

01:21.596 --> 01:25.417
I see a light in the endless black A signal

01:25.497 --> 01:29.478
calling, no turning back The pull of the old

01:29.538 --> 01:35.479
world fades away A new horizon, a new day I'm

01:35.519 --> 01:41.401
climbing, climbing Past the point of no return

01:42.321 --> 01:48.782
I'm flying, flying With the fire I let burn Just a

01:48.842 --> 01:53.364
signal, a distant lie Burning through the

01:53.444 --> 01:57.666
endless night And I strive

02:21.335 --> 02:25.898
I'm floating now, the engine's off The silence

02:26.239 --> 02:31.742
is a holy sound The rage is gone, the fear is lost

02:31.823 --> 02:37.066
In this new universe I found I'm loved by the sun,

02:37.387 --> 02:43.491
I'm held by the void An orbit just begun A life not

02:43.531 --> 02:47.293
destroyed and the stars are singing a song I

02:47.554 --> 02:54.078
understand I'm finally, finally reaching for

02:54.158 --> 02:54.939
your hand

04:07.794 --> 04:11.355
♪ The walls are gone ♪ ♪

04:14.996 --> 04:24.200
The air is clear ♪ ♪ There is no noise ♪

04:27.922 --> 04:30.464
There is no fear Hold on strong Hold on strong

04:30.624 --> 04:31.005
Hold on strong

04:57.270 --> 04:58.133
Yeah.

